<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="git-addon-resolve-a-file-conflict">
  <title>Resolve a File Conflict</title>
  <shortdesc>Clear a conflicting file by editing it in the compare editor or by keeping one whole
    side.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>resolving conflicts<indexterm>files</indexterm></indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <taskbody>
    <context>
      <p>Conflicting files appear in the
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs-unstaged-files"/>
        area. Resolve each one, then finish the operation.</p>
    </context>
    <steps>
      <step>
        <cmd>Right-click the conflicting file and open the
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-resolve"/>
          submenu.</cmd>
      </step>
      <step>
        <cmd>Choose how to resolve it.</cmd>
        <choices>
          <choice>Select
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-open-compare"/>,
            edit the file to keep the right content, then apply your changes.</choice>
          <choice>Select
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-resolve-mine"/>
            to keep your version, or
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-resolve-theirs"/>
            to keep the incoming version.</choice>
          <choice>After editing a file by hand, select
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-mark-resolved"/>.</choice>
        </choices>
      </step>
    </steps>
    <result>
      <p>The Git Client stages each resolved file automatically. When every file is resolved, finish
        the operation — see <xref href="git-addon-track-in-progress-operations.dita"/>.</p>
      <note type="tip">Let Positron propose a resolution with
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/conflict-resolve-with-ai"/>.
        See <xref href="git-addon-resolve-conflicts-with-ai.dita"/>.</note>
    </result>
  </taskbody>
</task>
